{"month":"1975-11","articles":[],"events":[{"id":"h-19e40906b57237cf","date":"1975-11-08","source":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1975%E2%80%9376_in_English_football#Diary_of_the_season","publisher":"위키백과 기여자","historyKind":"시즌 일지","dateBasis":"event-date-in-secondary-history","license":"CC-BY-SA-4.0","title":"맨체스터 유나이티드는 붉은 악마가 리버풀에게 패한 후 1위에서 3위로 떨어졌습니다. 새로운 리그 선두는 웨스트햄 유나이티드이며, 2위 더비는 런던 클럽과 승점차이가 납니다. 다른 곳에서는 리즈 유나이티드의 던컨 맥켄지와 맨체스터 시티의 콜린 벨이 그들의 클럽이 각각 뉴캐슬 유나이티드와 버밍엄 시티를 이길 수 있도록 도왔습니다.","titleTranslation":"machine","sourceLanguage":"en","kind":"history-record","priority":1},{"id":"h-4cbbeaf2b57c2026","date":"1975-11-12","source":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1975%E2%80%9376_in_English_football#Diary_of_the_season","publisher":"위키백과 기여자","historyKind":"시즌 일지","dateBasis":"event-date-in-secondary-history","license":"CC-BY-SA-4.0","title":"맨체스터 시티 thrash neighbours United 4–0 in the fourth round of the Football League Cup .","titleTranslation":"names","sourceLanguage":"en","kind":"history-record","priority":0},{"id":"h-0901354e91010672","date":"1975-11-19","source":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1975%E2%80%9376_in_English_football#Diary_of_the_season","publisher":"위키백과 기여자","historyKind":"시즌 일지","dateBasis":"event-date-in-secondary-history","license":"CC-BY-SA-4.0","title":"England draw 1–1 away to Portugal in their last European Championship qualifier, and must now hope that Czechoslovakia fail to beat Cyprus in order to qualify for the quarter-finals.","titleTranslation":"original","sourceLanguage":"en","kind":"history-record","priority":0},{"id":"h-2f74558aa155e8a6","date":"1975-11-23","source":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1975%E2%80%9376_in_English_football#Diary_of_the_season","publisher":"위키백과 기여자","historyKind":"시즌 일지","dateBasis":"event-date-in-secondary-history","license":"CC-BY-SA-4.0","title":"Czechoslovakia beat Cyprus 3–0 to confirm England's elimination from the European Championships.","titleTranslation":"original","sourceLanguage":"en","kind":"h